      "comment": "The Easter greeting of the Greek and Slavonic churches, Χριστὸς ἀνέστη — Ἀληθῶς ἀνέστη, given and answered from Easter night to the Ascension, put into the Latin of the Gospel: <span lang=\"la\">surrēxit Dominus vērē</span>. We have found no Latin form of the greeting itself in the reference works."
